abstract: >-
  A source-dated, bilingual-ready foundation seed for global travel intelligence.
  Version 0.1.0 contains 21 place records, 12 South America planning profiles,
  eight scoped Egyptian-passport tourism routes, 58 normalized sources, and 150
  field-level evidence relationships, with explicit freshness and governance controls.
